  1316	A concatenation of RRs, each in RFC 1035 §3.2.1 wire format, uncompressed, in RFC 4034 §6.2 canonical form (owner
  1317	name and every domain-name field inside RDATA, including the RRSIG signer name, lowercase and uncompressed).
  1318	1. **Groups, in order:** the root DNSKEY group; then for each zone z below the root down to the TXT's signer zone, a
  1319	   DS group at z and a DNSKEY group at z; last the TXT group at `_tessera-v1.<D>`. A group is a maximal run of RRs
  1320	   with the same owner, CLASS IN, and TYPE t (the RRset) or TYPE RRSIG with Type Covered t (its witnesses). The RRset
  1321	   comes first, in RFC 4034 §6.3 canonical RDATA order without duplicates, then zero or more RRSIGs in (key tag,
  1322	   inception, expiration, signature bytes) order. Each z is a proper descendant of the previous zone. Signer names:
  1323	   the parent for DS, z for DNSKEY, the root for the root group, the last z for TXT.
