+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | :36–37 | A10.1, opening clock claim | PASS |
+| 2 | :114 | A10.1, explicit success-definition qualification | PASS |
+| 3 | :133 | A10.1, signed-frame clock claim | PASS |
+| 4 | :144, C5 claim | A10.1, assembled C5 cell | PASS |
